{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L35-L64","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $\\gamma_k = \\mathbf{1} + \\varphi_0\\sigma_0 + \\varphi_1\\sigma_1 + \\varphi_{01}\\sigma_0\\sigma_1$ be a 4-term photon\n([Breit--Wheeler](#def:breit-wheeler-pair-production)).\nLet $\\mathfrak{N}(\\varphi_0, \\varphi_1, \\varphi_{01})$ denote the\nnucleon NF obtained by the derivation chain\n([4-term pair nucleon](#prop:four-term-pair-nucleon)):\n$\\gamma\\gamma \\to q\\bar{q} \\to \\mathcal{B}_3 \\cdot \\mathrm{crossings} \\to \\mathfrak{N}$.*\n\n*Then for all $\\varphi_0, \\varphi_1, \\varphi_{01} \\in \\mathbb{R}$:*\n\n$$\n  \\mathfrak{N}(\\varphi_0, \\varphi_1, \\varphi_{01})\n  =\n  \\mathfrak{N}(0, 0, 0)\n  =\n  \\mathrm{NF}(\\mathcal{B}_3 \\cdot \\mathrm{crossings}).\n$$\n\n*The nucleon NF depends only on $q$ and the quark flavor assignment.*\n\n## Proof\n\nThe Lean encoding below derives the equality from the hypothesis class. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-universality","label":"prop:confinement-universality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-universality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L33-L33","doc":"General polarization case equals reference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F_zero","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Zero-polarization case equals reference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture","kind":"class","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L28-L33","doc":"The physical hypotheses carried by the Confinement Universality Conjecture. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F_zero","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Reference zero-polarization nucleon NF value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L24-L24","doc":"Nucleon NF as a function of photon polarisation coefficients\n`(φ_0, φ_1, φ_01)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L21-L21","doc":"Neutron number `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.Z","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L19-L19","doc":"Proton number `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interaction